      "front": "From behind the caster: a green sigil on the ground ahead, a low wall of green mist rising off it and spores floating up through the mist.",
      "side": "The mist reads as a low, heavy band hugging the ground with spores and spattering sludge above it; the sigil is a thin bright line.",
      "top": "The sigil is the star: a glowing green circle of glyphs over a dark sludge stain with glowing cracks, mist puffs scattered across it.",
      "three_quarter": "Hero view. The sigil and stain lie on the ground, the mist rolls and rises off them, spores drift up and bubbles spit all over the field."
    }
