  "variation": {
    "seeded": true,
    "notes": "The sigil glyphs, stain shape, mist puffs, spores and spitting bubbles change per cast. The field size and the rot pulse every 1.6 s stay fixed (it's a damage-over-time area)."
  },
  "director_notes": "From Lisa's spells01 image, Cabalist - Pestilence Field: 'disease spreads, all things rot'. A ground-first area spell: the sigil draws itself (reveal_ms), a rot stain grows under it, glowing veins run out, then mist (alpha, dull green) and glow patches (add) rise over it with spores, spitting sludge and a few flies (leaf look in the shadow color). In an engine, loop the fester beat for the field's duration and fire a rot pulse on each damage tick."
